    <message name="UPARAM.DAMAGE_BLOCK.NAME" value="Damage block"/>
    <message name="UPARAM.BOUNCE_PROTECTION" value="Gravity protection stops unit from being pushed by Firework, Bat, Gravity gun, Electroshocker, Vacuum grenade, Stunt mine, Girder gun, Electric harpoon, Gas grenade, Blocker, Uzi and their upgrades, as well as Robot electric charges – but not limited to this list only! Protection lasts for indicated amount of turns since the first turn. If unit picks up hat with Gravity protection, turn counter will reset, unless that hat has already given Protection."/>
    <message name="UPARAM.PENETRATION">
        <![CDATA[Armor penetration is the stat that allows physical damage weapons to deal damage, ignoring part of victim's defense stat. Fraction of armor ignored is denoted in percentage in stats table.{br}For example, if you have 40% Armor penetration, and your enemy has 50 points of armor: 40% out of 50 is 20, so enemy will take damage as they have 30 armor instead of 50.]]>
    </message>
    <message name="UPARAM.LEECH">
        <![CDATA[Vampirism is the ability to regenerate stat owner's health by denoted percentage off the damage dealt to units. Vampirism does not benefit from Heal bonus stat. Vampirism does not work when unit's health is full, there is enemy Blocker or Pesky Puppet is on the unit. Also, Vampirism only works on allied turns, both stat owner team's and their partner's turns.]]>
    </message>
    <message name="UPARAM.REGENERATION">
        <![CDATA[Regeneration is the ability to heal stat owner's health by denoted amount at the start of their team's turn. Heal bonus directly influences Regeneration healing, as well as Ruinousness and Health theft. Regeneration does not work when unit's health is full, there is enemy Blocker or Pesky Puppet is on the unit.]]>
    </message>
    <message name="UPARAM.DAMAGE_BLOCK">
        <![CDATA[Damage block is the ability to reduce upcoming physical (and only physical) damage by denoted amount from every Nth attack (frequency denoted in the stat description, usually it's every 3rd attack).]]>
    </message>
    <message name="UPARAM.FORTITUDE">
        <![CDATA[Weighting decreases wearer's knockback from different sources, such as Bat, Gravity gun and explosions.]]>
    </message>
    <message name="UPARAM.REPELL">
        <![CDATA[Repell gives denoted chance to reflect upcoming projectile, without taking any damage. Reflected projectiles can even deal damage to their owner! Stat can be temporarily turned off by Hypnotic elixir.]]>
    </message>
    <message name="UPARAM.DODGE">
        <![CDATA[Dodge allows to miss upcoming attack, fully or partially evading damage. Some attacks (e.g. burning fire) cannot be dodged. Stat can be temporarily turned off by Hypnotic elixir. First dodge is always random, but subsequent are predetermined after certain amount of attacks: for N% dodge chance there are 100 / N attacks needed.{br}For example: if you have 10% dodge chance, subsequent dodges will be every 100 / 10 = 10 attacks.]]>
    </message>
    <message name="UPARAM.REVIVAL_HP">
        <![CDATA[Increases by denoted percentage health of zombies, revived by Zombie racial ability "Uprising from the grave". Does not work on zombies, revived or spawned by Zombie march and Resurrection seal weapons.]]>
    </message>
    <message name="UPARAM.REVENGE_DAMAGE">
        <![CDATA[Increases by denoted percentage damage by Zombie racial ability "Revenge from the grave".]]>
    </message>
    <message name="UPARAM.POISONING_ADDITION">
        <![CDATA[Poison debuffs inflicted by stat owner or poisonous gas clouds created by them last for denoted amount of turns longer. Opposite to 'Poisoning' stat of units. Poison duration from hats, artifacts and sets sums up without any restrictions.]]>
    </message>
    <message name="UPARAM.IMMOBILITY_ADDITION">
        <![CDATA[Freezing debuffs inflicted by stat owner or frozen gas clouds created by them last for denoted amount of turns longer. Opposite to 'Frozenness' stat of units. Freezing duration from hats, artifacts and sets sums up without any restrictions.]]>
    </message>
    <message name="UPARAM.POISONING_REDUCTION">
        <![CDATA[Shortens duration of poison inflicted to stat owner by denoted amount (duration cannot be less than 1 turn). Also decreases amount of hits stat owner can take from poisonous gas clouds.]]>
    </message>
    <message name="UPARAM.IMMOBILITY_REDUCTION">
        <![CDATA[Shortens duration of freezing inflicted to stat owner by denoted amount. Also decreases amount of hits stat owner can take from frozen gas clouds.]]>
    </message>
    <!--  1.62: описания уникальных параметров (2)  -->
    <message name="UPARAM.DEATH_GRIP">
        <![CDATA[Death grip is the ability to down unit (both enemy and ally), if after receiving damage their health is equal or lower to Death grip value. To be activate, damage must be dealt by statowner themselves. Usually works only on one target per turn, unless there are several units who took equal amount of damage. Does not pierce through Alien's Crystal shield, though Grip damage cannot be dodged or blacked with regular methods. Each unit can be targeted by Grip only once per battle!]]>
    </message>
    <message name="UPARAM.ANTI_HEAL">
        <![CDATA[Ruinousness is an opposite to Heal bonus stat. For 3 turns it decreases efficiecy of victim's heals by denoted percent. It works on the same healing methods as Heal bonus, e.g. not working on vampirism, and does not work or healing through bosses' unique attacks. To inflict ruinousness, you need to deal at least 200 hp of damage to target during the same turn.]]>
    </message>
    <message name="UPARAM.INVERTER">
        <![CDATA[Inverter is the ability to permanently gain shock damage upon any ally's (except revived zombie's death) by denoted percent. Bonus stacks up to 3 times per battle.]]>
    </message>
    <message name="UPARAM.LEECH_REGENERATION">
        <![CDATA[Healing theft is the ability to reduce and gain denoted percentage from enemy's heals. It passively works on all enemies as long as stat owner is alive. Healing is not influenced by Heal bonus and does not work if unit's heath if sull, there is enemy Blocker or Pesky Puppet is on the unit (though enemy healing reduction is still active).]]>
    </message>
    <message name="UPARAM.DAMAGE_ACC_POISONER.NAME" value="Poison infliction from incoming damage"/>
    <message name="UPARAM.DAMAGE_ACC_POISONER" value="After receving mid-turn damage equal or greater to denoted amount, stat owner inflicts 1 turn of poison to the attacker (poison duration summs up). Duration is not affected by Poisoning or Poison duration stats. Does not work from incoming poison damage. Icoming damage can be taken through multiple turns."/>
    <message name="UPARAM.DAMAGE_DEALT_POISONER.NAME" value="Poison infliction from outgoing damage"/>
    <message name="UPARAM.DAMAGE_DEALT_POISONER" value="After dealing damage equal to denoted amount, stat owner inflicts poison to target for 1 turn (poison duration summs up). Duration is not affected by Poisonining or Poison duration stats. Several units can be poisoned during the same turn. Damage dealt with poison weapons isn't accounted. Damage can be dealt through multiple turns."/>
    <message name="UPARAM.FIRE_LEECH">
        <![CDATA[Fire vampirism works just like regular vampirism, but only from damage dealt with fire.]]>
    </message>
    <message name="UPARAM.EM_DISCHARGE.NAME" value="Electromagnetic impulse"/>
    <message name="UPARAM.EM_DISCHARGE" value="Releasis electromagnetic impulse upon stat owner's death, that deals damage to all enemies in a small radius and destroys all enemy objects in a radius: mines, guarding bots etc."/>
    <message name="UPARAM.SHOCK_REBOUND.NAME" value="Extra electric damage"/>
    <message name="UPARAM.SHOCK_REBOUND" value="After using electrical weapons against enemy, stat owner deals extra shock damage to them. Base extra damage is 20 hp and increased by 10 hp for every enemy (except revived zombies) stat owner's team has killed, up to 50 hp."/>
    <message name="UPARAM.FIRE_STEP">
        <![CDATA[Grants its owner the ability to leave a trail of burning embers, up to 6, that last for 1 turn and can deal 5 hp fire damage to enemies. If stat owner is a Dragon, they get +6 additional embers to their racial ability instead.]]>
    </message>
    <message name="UPARAM.WEAPON_DEVICE_DURATION">
        <![CDATA[Prolonges the duration of devices, such as Force field, Grounding bot, Blocker and their respective upgrades, as well as Projector, by denoted amount of turns. All these devices must be placed by stat owner to receive extended duration.]]>
    </message>
    <message name="UPARAM.ATTACK_POWER_ADDITION">
        <![CDATA[Pushback force increases the distance stat owner knocks back units. This stat does not influences Gravity protection or other states except Weightning. The greater attacker's Pushback force and lower target's Weightening, the bigger knockback will be received.]]>
    </message>
</dictionary>
